---
// Footer.astro
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="w-full py-12 px-4 border-t border-border bg-background mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8">
    <div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">aeo-seo</div>
    <div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-soft">
      © {year} aeo-seo. Продвижение сайтов в ИИ и классическом SEO.
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <a class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Telegram</a>
      <a class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
